    <h1>Hiring a freelance developer vs. <em>one person who builds and looks after your site</em></h1>
    <p>A freelancer, whether from Upwork, Fiverr, a friend's referral, or a design student, often bids 30% to 60% below a regional agency. You pay once and get a website. This page compares what happens after launch, when the freelancer moves on.</p>
