    <h2>What one extra call a week is worth</h2>
    <p>A freelancer is the easiest option on day one and one of the hardest by day 365. In a worked example for a typical local business, a $500 average job and one extra call a week come to $26,000 a year in potential work. So if you don't work with code, ongoing care that keeps your site ranking for years is worth more than a low bid.</p>

